  "result": "Quiz 0002 on O4 is ready: `quizzes/0002.json`, with its key in `keys/0002.json`. I didn't run any solver check. I answered each item from its stem alone and they matched the key.\n\n- **Contents:** six items, three multiple choice, one numeric and two short answer. They cover who owns the control flow, classifying a booking design, a cost comparison in model calls, why a fixed workflow suits known steps, which task is a real agent candidate, and answering \"make it all one agent\".\n- **Context:** the examples come from the makerspace assistant, and the cost item ties to the budget constraint. The source is Anthropic's \"Building effective agents\".\n- **Ahead of the lessons:** no lesson on O4 exists yet, so this is a check of the objective itself and is ahead of the lessons.\n- **Misconceptions:** the key's multiple-choice items have no `distractors` mapping. None of the workspace's existing misconception ids (M1, M3, M4, M6) fits these wrong answers, and I didn't want to invent new ids. The rationales describe the typical errors in words.\n\nDo you want a lesson on O4 before you take it?",
